      "floor": {
        "amount": 1800,
        "appliesTo": "Basic monthly salary, Singapore production and operator roles",
        "source": "JTE, November 2026",
        "short": "The basic is only half the story here. Aim for a gross around S$3,000.",
        "long": "Production pay runs a lower basic than most sectors, with overtime and incentives making up the rest. S$1,800 basic is about the lowest anyone will take. S$2,000 is normal. S$2,200 to S$2,500 gets you noticeably better people. But the number they judge is the gross, and around S$3,000 wins them. Fewer people want heavy overtime now, so a package that only works with lots of OT is a hard sell.",
        "displayAmount": 3000
      },
      "note": "The basic is only half the picture here. How simple or complex the job is moves the pay as much as the band does. At the bottom of the range, fewer people apply and the search takes longer."
